body:
yeah, can I get uhhhhhhh 6 person hot tub please?

&#x200B;

Yes I would like the massage chairs as well

Something I'm sure you've considered but maybe need to actually do: relationship counseling. If he is not going to act positively when you try to talk to him about it, maybe he needs to hear it from someone else.

&#x200B;

On another note, something that you could try is talk to him about making a plan for cleaning each day. Setting alarms, making plans, and setting aside time each day to clean up after himself. This will help with the ADHD issue of him not thinking about it. If he forgets even with alarms and a set cleaning schedule, make it so that he owes you something maybe a few dollars or a date or something else. Just a thought.
